nly in that One Side unless the employment is exercised in the Other Side. If the employment is exercised in the Other Side, such remuneration as is derived therefrom may be taxed in that Other Side.\u8221??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\li0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi720\li0\tx1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 To add to the Arrangement:}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\li0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8220??}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Article 18A\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Teachers and Researchers\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs12\qc\sb0\sa0\li0\sl120{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs12\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0  \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi720\li0\tx1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li0\cf1 \f0 Where an individual is employed by a university, college, school in One Side or by an educational institution or scientific research institution recognized by the Government of One Side and is, or was immediately before visiting the Other Side, a resident of that One Side and is present in that Other Side for the primary purpose of teaching or research at a university, college, school in that Other Side or at an educational institution or s